  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NESA Center / AFRICOM &quot;The New Face of Security, Conflict, and War&quot; Workshop 01-25</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The group will take a broad review of a region inundated now and in the future with changing security challenges and analyze both internal (urbanization, crime, narcotics, demographics, environmental, etc.) and external drivers (international players: Russia, China, Gulf, U.S., etc.); as well as developments (artificial intelligence, robots, drones, 3D printing, supply chains, etc.), all critical to establishing effective future national, regional and international strategies.</narrative>
  </description>
